ost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155569417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3301490-1830163047262627","game_id":"steam-3301490","kind":"update","title":"RealmWalker Demo - Patch 0.6.5","summary":"New FeaturesAdded multiple save slotsAdded graphics presetsAdded support for side mouse buttonsAdded new room variations and layoutsImproved intro/logo sequence playbackPlayer now breaks destructible objects on collisionAdded new VFX for:Overloading Circuits (Lightning Touch)Healing AltarQuake FieldBalance ChangesPlayer movement speed increased (600 → 700)Minion Turret HP reduced (1300 → 1000)Cycloguard speed, damage, and cooldown reducedLightning Touch cooldown reduced and AoE behavior improved","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-18T15:44:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047262627","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3301490-1829528821315855","game_id":"steam-3301490","kind":"announcement","title":"RealmWalker Demo Out Now – Enter Setsara Today","summary":"Welcome to Setsara!The RealmWalker demo is officially live and available to everyone. Yes, right now. Go play it!We’re incredibly excited to finally give you a first glimpse of the roguelite magic we’ve been building. Here’s what you can experience in the demo:20+ unique spells, each with 3 augmentationsThe first 2 tiers of the persistent progression tree20+ powerful Auras to shape your buildThe Shifting Dunes map and its deadly guardianYour feedback means everything to us. If you’ve played the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-13T16:00:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821315855","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3301490-1827626365766988","game_id":"steam-3301490","kind":"announcement","title":"Enemy Spotlight: The Cycloguard","summary":"Hey RealmWalkers!With our Demo launch less than 2 weeks away, it’s time to meet one of the towering foes that patrol The Shifting Dunes, the earth realm prison you’ll explore first in RealmWalker - the Cycloguard. Once nomadic warriors of sand and stone, these brutes now serve under Anuragon, leader of all the Cyclotaurs, forming an elite line of defense. Their thick skin and immense strength make them formidable opponents.Watch out for their devastating attacks:Ground Pound: The Cyclotaur lands","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T00:11:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365766988","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3301490-1826992588592326","game_id":"steam-3301490","kind":"announcement","title":"Spell Deep Dive: Temporal Shift","summary":"Hey RealmWalkers! Welcome to our first Spell Deep Dive! Today we’re exploring Temporal Shift, an Arcane spell built for crowd control and tactical dominance. Casting Temporal Shift creates a pocket of distorted time around you. Enemies caught inside move in slow motion, giving you a perfect window to unleash your strongest attacks. With upgrades, its power grows:Buff Refresh: Extend the duration of your active buffs while in the domain.Guaranteed Stasis: When the effect ends, enemies are locked ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-12T13:03:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588592326","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses